# The OSCAL corpora and the CIS Benchmarks used to be excluded here. Both are
# committed now, on the call recorded in BUILD-LOG.md: the artifacts page names
# every document each approach ships, and a row naming a file nobody can open is
# a count a reader has to take on trust.
#
# What is committed and what is linked is decided in tools/copy_examples.py.
# The catalog-first corpus is not here: it is published in a public repository
# and its rows link there, so 231 files do not need a second home.
